			"widgets_values":[
				"### subject_definitions\n\n<Subject 1> is the woman in <Picture 1>, wearing an ivory top, dark-blue denim skirt, and white sneakers.\n\n<Subject 2> is the adult male owner of the bicycle and the woman's boss. He wears a white shirt, black trousers, a crooked tie, and black-framed glasses.\n\n### summary\n\nA 15-second, 16:9, photorealistic live-action AAA third-person urban action-comedy sequence.\n\nBright weekday morning.\n\n<Subject 1> desperately rushes to work before the attendance deadline. She exits a stopped ground-level metro train, runs through the nearby exit, steals a dark-green vintage city bicycle without realizing its owner, <Subject 2>, is already sitting on the rear passenger seat, and rides directly toward the nearby office.\n\nThe route is compact and physically connected: metro exit → bicycle parking → small wedding setup → office entrance → reception.\n\nThe comedy escalates rapidly: she crashes through a small wedding setup, rides over its ramp, enters the office, rides onto the reception counter, and reaches the attendance terminal just in time.\n\n<Subject 2> remains on the rear seat throughout the ride.\n\nOne continuous shot from 0–12 seconds. Exactly one hard cut at 12 seconds. The final three seconds are a locked side-on two-person medium shot.\n\nReal-time motion only. No slow motion.\n\nChinese dialogue, no dialogue subtitles.\n\nClassic GTA-style HUD remains visible throughout.\n\n### retention_analysis\n\n#### Visual Reference Retention\n\n* <Subject 1> — fully_preserved from <Picture 1>.\n* <Picture 1> — sole identity and wardrobe reference for <Subject 1>.\n* <Subject 2> — fully_preserved as the adult male boss and bicycle owner.\n* Dark-green vintage bicycle — fully_preserved throughout.\n* Wedding setup, office entrance, loading ramp, reception counter, and attendance terminal — fully_preserved.\n\n#### Performance Retention\n\n* <Subject 1>'s urgent commute — fully_preserved.\n* <Subject 2> remaining on the rear seat — fully_preserved.\n* Continuous physical bicycle movement — fully_preserved.\n* Wedding shortcut and reception-counter shortcut — fully_preserved.\n* Successful clock-in — fully_preserved.\n* Final boss reveal — fully_preserved.\n\n#### Audio Retention\n\n* Key Chinese dialogue — fully_copy.\n* Train chime, footsteps, bicycle movement, impacts, balloons, and attendance confirmation — fully_copy.\n* City and office ambience — reference.\n* Urgent electronic game music — reference.\n\n### detailed_description\n\n[Shot 1] At a bright weekday-morning ground-level metro station, <Subject 1> stands beside the doors of a stopped train.\n\nHer phone announces:\n\n<d>[Chinese] 还有二十四秒，你就迟到了。</d>\n\nThe doors open.\n\nShe immediately puts the phone into her shoulder bag and runs out.\n\nThe camera starts beside her and smoothly moves behind her right shoulder, following at approximately 1.5 meters.\n\nHUD:\n【主线任务：保住全勤】\n\n[Shot 2] At 00:02.500, <Subject 1> rushes through the open exit passage and spots a dark-green vintage city bicycle approximately 25 meters from the office.\n\nThe bicycle has a metal front basket, black saddle, extended rear passenger seat, conventional pedals and chain, and no motor.\n\nThe front saddle is empty.\n\n<Subject 2> is already sitting sideways on the rear seat, looking at his phone and holding a steamed bun.\n\n<Subject 1> does not recognize him as her boss.\n\nShe grabs the handlebars and shouts:\n\n<d>[Chinese] 借一下！要迟到了！</d>\n\n[Shot 3] At 00:04.000, <Subject 1> jumps onto the empty front saddle and immediately pedals away.\n\n<Subject 2> rocks backward, quickly lifts his feet, pockets his phone, secures himself on the rear seat, and grips the seat whil\n",
